{"ability_id":"da-boss","name":"Da Boss","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"faction","rules_text":"At the start of the battle round, if a model with this ability is your WARLORD, gain 1CP.","faction_id":"orks","source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"boss-ammo-runt","name":"Boss’ Ammo Runt","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"In your Shooting phase, when this unit is selected to shoot, you can use this ability. If you do, this model’s ranged attacks have +1 to hit rolls.\nPlace a Boss’ Ammo Runt token next to the unit, removing it when this ability is used.","usage":"Once per battle, per unit","unit_ids":["warboss"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"unstable-energies","name":"Unstable Energies","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"faction","rules_text":"Orks Psyker units with this ability have a psyker level of 1 or higher, specified in that unit’s abilities. Each psychic ability has a psychic level of 1 or higher, specified in that ability’s name.\nIn a battle round, a friendly ORKS PSYKER unit can use a number of psychic abilities whose total psychic level does not exceed that PSYKER unit’s psyker level.\nExample: In a battle round, a psyker level 3 PSYKER unit could use three psychic level 1abilities, or one psychic level 1 ability and one psychic level 2 ability, or one psychic level 3 ability.","faction_id":"orks","source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"deff-from-the-shadows","name":"Deff from the Shadows","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"At the end of your opponent’s Movement phase, if this unit is in strategic reserves, this unit can make an ingress move.","usage":"First battle round onwards","unit_ids":["boss-snikrot"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"clever-know-wotz","name":"Clever Know-wotz","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"In your Movement phase, at the start or end of this unit’s move, you can select one friendly Orks Vehicle model (excluding AIRCRAFT/TITANIC models) within 3\" of this model:\n• That VEHICLE model heals D3 wounds.\n• That VEHICLE model’s attacks have +1 to hit rolls until the start of your next Movement phase.","unit_ids":["mek"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"catch-dat-red-bit","name":"Catch Dat Red Bit","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"When this model uses its Crude Surgery ability, you can add D3 to the number of wounds healed.\nPlace a Grot Orderly token next to the unit, removing it when this ability is used.","usage":"Once per battle, per unit","unit_ids":["painboy"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"pilin-out","name":"Pilin’ Out","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"In your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8\" of this model, units embarked within this model can make a disembark move using the rapid disembark mode.","unit_ids":["trukk"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"aerial-manoover","name":"Aerial Manoover","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"At the end of your opponent’s Fight phase, if this unit is unengaged, you can place this unit in strategic reserves.","unit_ids":["deffkoptas"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"go-fer-da-weak-spot","name":"Go fer da Weak Spot","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"In your Shooting phase, this unit’s ranged attacks that target a MONSTER/VEHICLE unit have +1 to wound rolls.","unit_ids":["wazbom-blastajet"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"finderz-keeperz","name":"Finderz Keeperz","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"In your Shooting phase, if any of the following apply, this unit’s ranged attacks have +1 AP:\n• This unit is within range of an objective.\n• The target of that attack is within range of an objective.","unit_ids":["flash-gitz"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"damaged-10","name":"Damaged: 1-10 Wounds Remaining","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"core","rules_text":"DAMAGED24.39\nThis ability always takes the form Damaged X. While a model’s remaining wounds are equal to or less than X, that model is damaged: while damaged, that model’s attacks have -1 to hit rolls.","source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"support-shokka","name":"Support Shokka","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"While this model is within 3\" of a friendly Orks Infantry unit (excluding BIG MEK WITH SHOKK ATTACK GUN units), this model has Lone Operative.","unit_ids":["big-mek-with-shokk-attack-gun"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"wurrboy","name":"Wurrboy","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"This model has the psychic abilities listed in the Psychic Abilities section.","usage":"psyker level 1","unit_ids":["kill-rig"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"sumfin-to-prove","name":"Sumfin’ to Prove","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"This unit’s melee attacks have +1 to hit rolls.","unit_ids":["bigboss"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"},
{"ability_id":"speednob-support","name":"Speednob Support","authored_by":"wahapedia","game_version":{"edition":"11th","dataslate":"codex"},"ability_type":"unit","faction_id":"orks","rules_text":"While each model in this unit is within 3\" of a friendly Speed Freeks unit (excluding WARTRAKK units), this unit has Lone Operative.","unit_ids":["wartrakks"],"source":"wahapedia-11e@2026-10-16"}
